To smooth at row (a whole number) with column (a whole number).
The total is 0.
The count is 0.
For every offset from 0 to 8.
The down is offset divided by 3 minus 1.
The across is offset modulo 3 minus 1.
The actualrow is row plus down.
The actualcolumn is column plus across.
The inside is 0.
If actualrow is at least 0 and actualrow is less than 3 and actualcolumn is at least 0 and actualcolumn is less than 3, set inside to 1.
If inside is 1, set total to total plus item (actualrow times 3 plus actualcolumn) of grid.
If inside is 1, add 1 to count.
If offset is 8, set average to total divided by count.

